<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.steward.seals`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "seal a realm bag's steward record by join, cosign or steward"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.steward.seals", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.steward.seals"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.steward.seals"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.steward.seals ~ a name enters a record by its own hand first

`lares nexus realm-bag <bag-uri> [realm=<id>] [join=true | cosign=true [with=<key>]] [steward=<key>…] [tier=<t>] [expiry=<rolls>] [charter=<key>=<realm-id>…]` seals the record of who keeps a realm bag, riding the key the acting face (`face=N`) presents to the realm's Nexus. `join=true` asks to keep a bag another hand keeps; `cosign=true` consents to a record naming this vessel's steward. With no `realm=` the act lands in the charter-derived realm.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ join

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`join` params=`bag/<bag-uri> join/true ~ ask to keep a bag`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ bag · realm · join · cosign · with · steward · tier · expiry · charter · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag` params=`takes/uri needs/required seat/1 as/<bag-uri> ~ the realm bag`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/id ~ a cabal realm (64 hex); absent, the charter-derived realm`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`join` params=`kind/switch ~ ask to keep a bag another hand keeps`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cosign` params=`kind/switch ~ consent to a record naming this vessel's steward`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`with` params=`takes/key ~ beside cosign, the key consented with`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`steward` params=`takes/list ~ hands that already sealed a record of this realm`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tier` params=`takes/word ~ the bag's tier`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`expiry` params=`takes/count ~ rolls before the record lapses`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`charter` params=`takes/list ~ key=realm-id pairs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the acting face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face ~ the acting face's key seals`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.steward.seals bag/<bag-uri> join/true]] ~ no bag named, or a malformed flag`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ sealed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`sealed` params=`exit/0 ~ the record landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus realm-bag

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus realm-bag]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

